&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the approved plans and prior to the commencement of works (other than works of demolition), a scheme of hard and soft landscape works for the site submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Soft landscape works shall include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;a scheme of hard and soft landscape works which shall include a survey of all existing trees and hedgerows on the land, indicating those to be retained and those to be lost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Landscape master plan,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;c.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;planting plans (at a scale not less than 1:100),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;d.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;schedules of plants, noting species, plant sizes, plant container sizes (all at time of planting) and proposed numbers / densities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;e.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;Written specification of planting and cultivation works to be undertaken&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;f.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;A landscape implementation programme with proposed timing / dates for the works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hard landscape works shall include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;g.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;Details of boundary treatments (materials, scale of boundary, location),&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;h.&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;Details of hard surfacing materials to be used in the landscaping of the site,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;i.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Written specification of planting and cultivation works to be undertaken.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The
development shall be completed in accordance with the approved details and
shall thereafter be retained.&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
